---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Bloc Microfinance Bank | Banking for individuals and businesses" description="Bloc is a CBN-licensed microfinance bank in Nigeria. Send money, save, borrow and pay bills, or open a business account for payments, payroll and supply chain finance." path="/" section="home" preload="/assets/photo-market-woman.webp">
<section class="hero hm" aria-labelledby="h1"><div class="w"><div class="hl"><div class="chip"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg><span>Licensed by the CBN. Insured by NDIC.</span></div>
<h1 id="h1">Banking for individuals<br>and businesses.</h1><p class="sub">Send money, save, borrow and run your business accounts, all with Bloc.</p><div class="hbtns"><a class="btn g" href="/personal/">Personal banking</a><a class="btn w2" href="/business/">Business banking</a></div></div><div class="hp"><img class="pimg" src="/assets/photo-market-woman.webp" alt="A smiling market trader checking her phone at her stall in Lagos" width="1536" height="1024" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><div class="fc c1"><span class="fi2"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 7"/></svg></span><span>Transfer successful<small>₦25,000.00 to Chika Obi</small></span></div><div class="fc c2"><span class="fi2"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 12h-6l-2 3h-4l-2-3H2"/><path d="M5.45 5.11L2 12v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6l-3.45-6.89A2 2 0 0 0 16.76 4H7.24a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11z"/></svg></span><span>Payment received<small>₦50,000.00 · Business account</small></span></div></div></div></section><section class="stmt" aria-label="Regulation"><div class="w"><div><div class="lab "><i class="ch"></i><span>Regulation</span></div><h2 style="margin-top:16px">Licensed by the CBN.<br>Insured by the NDIC.</h2>
<p>Bloc Microfinance Bank operates under a licence from the Central Bank of Nigeria. Deposits are insured by the Nigeria Deposit Insurance Corporation, subject to its limits.</p></div>
<div class="sl"><div class="ti"><div class="tl"><img width="141" height="150" src="/assets/reg-cbn.png" alt="CBN logo"></div><div><b>Licensed by the CBN</b><span>Central Bank of Nigeria</span></div></div><div class="ti"><div class="tl"><img width="420" height="178" src="/assets/reg-ndic.png" alt="NDIC logo"></div><div><b>Insured by NDIC</b><span>Nigeria Deposit Insurance Corporation</span></div></div><div class="ti"><div class="tl"><img width="160" height="160" src="/assets/reg-ndpc.png" alt="NDPC logo"></div><div><b>NDPA compliant</b><span>Nigeria Data Protection Act</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="sec sky" id="choose"><div class="w">
<div class="lab "><i class="ch"></i><span>Our banking</span></div>
<h2>Choose how you bank.</h2>
<div class="two">
<article class="pc"><img width="1536" height="1024" class="bgp" src="/assets/photo-personal.webp" alt="A young woman smiling at her phone on a Lagos street" loading="lazy"><div class="pcc"><div class="lab "><i class="ch"></i><span>Personal</span></div><h3>Everyday banking on your phone.</h3><p>Send money to any bank, save for a goal, borrow and pay bills.</p>
<div class="pills"><span>Send money</span><span>Save money</span><span>Take loan</span><span>Pay bills</span></div><a class="btn" href="/personal/">Explore Personal <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div></article>
<article class="pc"><img width="1536" height="1024" class="bgp" src="/assets/photo-market-man.webp" alt="A trader smiling at his phone at his fabric stall" loading="lazy" style="object-position:50% 20%"><div class="pcc"><div class="lab "><i class="ch"></i><span>Business</span></div><h3>Banking for your company.</h3><p>Collect payments, pay suppliers and give your team the right access.</p>
<div class="pills"><span>Collections</span><span>Transfers</span><span>Statements</span></div><a class="btn" href="/business/">Explore Business <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div></article>
</div></div></section><section class="sec cream" id="why"><div class="w">
<div class="lab "><i class="ch"></i><span>Why Bloc</span></div>
<h2>Why choose Bloc.</h2>
<div class="grid3">
<div class="bcard ch"><div class="ib ch" style="background:var(--gold)"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></div><h3>Licensed and insured</h3><p>Licensed by the Central Bank of Nigeria. Deposits insured by the NDIC, subject to its limits.</p></div>
<div class="bcard ch"><div class="ib ch" style="background:var(--pink)"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg></div><h3>Fees you see first</h3><p>Every transfer shows its fee before you confirm.</p></div>
<div class="bcard ch"><div class="ib ch" style="background:var(--steel)"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg></div><h3>Safe by design</h3><p>Protections like one trusted phone and alerts on every sign-in.</p></div>
</div></div></section><section class="dl" id="download" style="padding-top:104px"><div class="w"><div class="ctas">
<div class="dbox ch"><div class="t"><h2>Download the Bloc app.</h2><p>Open your account in a few steps.</p>
<div class="stores"><a class="store d" href="https://apps.apple.com/app/bloc-microfinance-bank/id6788473815" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="si"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#0B2E66" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.152 6.896c-.948 0-2.415-1.078-3.96-1.04-2.04.027-3.91 1.183-4.961 3.014-2.117 3.675-.546 9.103 1.519 12.09 1.013 1.454 2.208 3.09 3.792 3.039 1.52-.065 2.09-.987 3.935-.987 1.831 0 2.35.987 3.96.948 1.637-.026 2.676-1.48 3.676-2.948 1.156-1.688 1.636-3.325 1.662-3.415-.039-.013-3.182-1.221-3.22-4.857-.026-3.04 2.48-4.494 2.597-4.559-1.429-2.09-3.623-2.324-4.39-2.376-2-.156-3.675 1.09-4.61 1.09zM15.53 3.83c.843-1.012 1.4-2.427 1.245-3.83-1.207.052-2.662.805-3.532 1.818-.78.896-1.454 2.338-1.273 3.714 1.338.104 2.715-.688 3.559-1.701"/></svg></span><span class="st"><small>Download on the</small><b>App Store</b></span></a><a class="store d" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.blocmfb.mobile" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="si"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="#00A0FF" d="M3.6 1.6 14 12 3.6 22.4c-.4-.3-.6-.8-.6-1.4V3c0-.6.2-1.1.6-1.4z"/><path fill="#00E27A" d="M3.6 1.6c.4-.3 1-.3 1.6 0l12 6.9-3.2 3.5z"/><path fill="#FFCE00" d="m17.2 8.5 3.6 2.1c.8.5.8 1.7 0 2.2l-3.6 2.1L14 12z"/><path fill="#FF3A44" d="m5.2 22.4 12-6.9-3.2-3.5-10.4 10.4c.6.2 1.2.2 1.6 0z"/></svg></span><span class="st"><small>Get it on</small><b>Google Play</b></span></a></div></div></div>
<div class="dbox nv ch"><div class="t"><h2>Open a business account.</h2><p>For registered businesses. Start your application online.</p>
<a class="btn g" href="https://ibank.blocmfb.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open a business account <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div></div>
</div></div></section>
</Layout>
